{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Kiln & Co. — Brand Intro",
    "description": "A five-second brand intro for a ceramics shop: the mug rises into a warm kiln glow with embers, an iris opens onto cream, and the wordmark assembles letter by letter around it with the tagline."
